+From 7fce6c4e5ccc6db058892b0929dd38417bd37e27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Zhiyi Zhang <zzhang@codeweavers.com>
+Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 18:13:32 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH 01/65] HACK: dxgi: Add a
+ dxgi_factory_CreateSwapChainForComposition() stub.
+
+For debugging only because we will need to use DXVK's dxgi.
+---
+ dlls/dxgi/factory.c | 5 ++++-
+ 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
